server.detail:
Add asserts for these cases:
- norm merges two percent-number variants into one trap with hits 2;
- an exact saved re-serve answered right leaves owed and mastery unchanged and files repeat=1;
- a marked right answer opens an unsure trap with owed 1;
- test marks survive GET session and the move to module 2, and reach results.review[].marked and /api/review/marked after finish;
- /api/review/item returns 404 for an unanswered challenge item and for another learner's item;
- redo with a half-fixed trap gives total 1 for that template;
- dismiss then restore;
- the history cursor pages strictly older;
- carry moves marks.
